      <description>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;tg-emoji emoji-id="5355148941878900494"&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29C96.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;✖️&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/tg-emoji&gt; &lt;a href="https://x.com/TheHustle/status/2119868798790733830" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;The Hustle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This company is arming farmers with lasers.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/carbon_robotics" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;@carbon_robotics&lt;/a&gt; trained its Large Plant Model on more than 150 million labeled plant images.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;As plants pass underneath the LaserWeeder, cameras capture them and the AI decides what’s a crop and what’s a weed.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The system can even adapt to new plants it hasn’t encountered before and learn whether to protect them or target them.&lt;/div&gt;
